:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=50.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Program size (decompressed) and limit information
