:DATAI VAR=SIZECUR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SIZECUR'.Current
:DATAI VAR=SIZEMAX USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SIZEMAX'.Maximum
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Number of modules
:DATAI VAR=MODCUR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODCUR'.Current
