:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SRVSRV BOTSEP=NONE KEYL=SRVKEYS HELP=DSPSRVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Service Program Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=42.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Service program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OWNER'.Owner
:DATAI VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMATTR'.Service program attribute
:DATAI VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DETAIL'.Detail
:DATACOL WIDTH=1.
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=SRVS SCROLL=YES.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5' HELP='SRVSRV/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='SRVSRV/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=SRVNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRVNAME'.Service Program
:LISTCOL VAR=SRVLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRVLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=SRVACT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRVACT'.Activation
:LISTCOL VAR=SRVSIG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRVSIG'.Signature
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=SRVEXP BOTSEP=NONE KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=DSPSRVH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Service Program Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=6.
:DATACOL WIDTH=42.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Service program
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OWNER'.Owner
:DATAI VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMATTR'.Service program attribute
:DATAI VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DETAIL'.Detail
:DATACOL WIDTH=1.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&EXPHEAD.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=EXPS VIEWS=2 SCROLL=YES.&EXPEMPTY.
:LISTCOL VAR=PROCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PROCNAME'.Procedure Name
:LISTCOL VAR=ARGOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ARGOPT'.ARGOPT
:LISTCOL VAR=DATANAME USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DATANAME'.Data Item
:LISTCOL VAR=DATASIZE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DATASIZE'.Size
:LISTVIEW COLS='PROCNAME ARGOPT'.
:LISTVIEW COLS='DATANAME DATASIZE'.
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
.* --- the module's displays
:PANEL NAME=MODBASIC KEYL=KEYS HELP=DSPMODH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Module Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Module
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DETAIL'.Detail
:DATAI VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMATTR'.Module attribute
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES.
:DATACOL WIDTH=57.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.Module information
:DATAI VAR=CRTDT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CRTDT'.Module creation date/time
:DATAI VAR=SRCF USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCF'.Source file
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=SRCFLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCFLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=SRCMBR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCMBR'.Source member
:DATAI VAR=SRCCHG USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/SRCCHG'.Source file change date/time
:DATAI VAR=OWNER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OWNER'.Owner
:DATAI VAR=CCSID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CCSID'.Coded character set identifier
:DATAI VAR=MODTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODTEXT'.Text description
:DATAC.
:DATAI VAR=CRTDTA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CRTDTA'.Creation data
:DATAI VAR=ILDATA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ILDATA'.Intermediate language data
:DATAI VAR=COMPILER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/COMPILER'.Compiler
:DATAI VAR=OPTIONS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/OPTIONS'.Creation options
:DATAI VAR=DBGVIEW USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DBGVIEW'.Debug view
:DATAI VAR=DBGDATA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DBGDATA'.Debug data
:DATAI VAR=MODACTGRP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/MODACTGRP'.Activation group
:DATAI VAR=PEP USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PEP'.Program entry procedure
:DATAI VAR=NBRPROC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/NBRPROC'.Number of procedures
:DATAI VAR=STCSIZE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/STCSIZE'.Static storage size
:DATAI VAR=CODESIZE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CODESIZE'.Code size
:DATAI VAR=CODEGEN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/CODEGEN'.Code generator version
:EDATAGRP.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=MODPROC KEYL=LISTKEYS HELP=DSPMODH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=NONE.Display Module Information
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=63.
:DATAC.
:DATACOL WIDTH=15.
:DATAC.&DSPPOS.
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=5.
:DATACOL WIDTH=32.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI VAR=PGM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGM'.Module
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAI VAR=PGMLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMLIB'.Library
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAI VAR=DETAIL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DETAIL'.Detail
:DATAI VAR=PGMATTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PGMATTR'.Module attribute
:EDATA.
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAC.&PROCHEAD.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PROCS SCROLL=YES.(The module has no procedures.)
:LISTCOL VAR=PROCNAME USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=46 HELP='FLD/PROCNAME'.Procedure Name
:LISTCOL VAR=PROCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/PROCTYPE'.Procedure Type
:LISTCOL VAR=ARGOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/ARGOPT'.ARGOPT
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=DSPMODH.Display Module Information - Help
:P.A module's attributes: where its source came from, how it was
compiled, and its procedures. Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPGMH.Display Program Information - Help
:P.A program's attributes, one display per kind of detail: how and
when it was made, its size against the limits, the modules bound into
it, the service programs it binds to and what its activation group
exports and imports. Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPSRVH.Display Service Program Information - Help
:P.A service program's attributes, one display per kind of detail:
how and when it was made, its size, its modules, the service programs
it binds to, the procedures and data it exports and its signatures.
Press Enter for the next display.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 leaves the displays; F12 goes back one display. F17 and F18
move to the top and the bottom of a list. F11 shows a signature as
characters instead of hexadecimal.
:EHELP.
