:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PGMMOD/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.5=Display description
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display description it.
:PT.6=Print description
:PD.Type 6 next to an entry and press Enter to print description it.
:EPARML.
